372
00:17:29,360 --> 00:17:31,460
反正我是个不受欢迎的人。
I was stupid enough to think that I could get a date.

373
00:17:32,140 --> 00:17:34,460
噢，我倒是可以帮你来点新的
All I wanted was something new.

374
00:17:34,740 --> 00:17:38,000
来点不同的来点不一般的……
Something different,something unusual.

375
00:17:42,800 --> 00:17:45,860
如果我同意和你去跳舞的话
If I um,did agree to go to this dance with you,

376
00:17:47,130 --> 00:17:52,730
可我现在没有同意，但你得答应一些条件。
which I haven't,you'd have to agree to certain conditions.

377
00:17:52,730 --> 00:17:53,340
什么都行。
Anything.

378
00:17:53,340 --> 00:17:57,960
不准握手。不准跳得太慢但又不准跳得太快。
No hand holding. No slow dancing,no fast dancing..

379
00:17:58,660 --> 00:18:01,560
如果你同意和我去，我甚至可以不上场。
And if you agree to go with me,I don't even have to show up.

380
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:02,500
真的吗？
Do I ?

381
00:18:03,650 --> 00:18:04,310
当然。
No.

382
00:18:04,310 --> 00:18:07,330
那好吧那就这么说定了。
Well Ok,you've got your date.

383
00:18:07,330 --> 00:18:10,970
你身上确实有不一般的东西。
And you've got something uh unusual.

384
00:18:49,200 --> 00:18:50,600
路易？！
Louis?

385
00:18:50,600 --> 00:18:52,500
Seaver小子！
Seaver Face.

386
00:18:52,500 --> 00:18:54,640
我听说你在找我。
I hear you've been looking for me.

387
00:18:55,450 --> 00:18:56,340
对。
Yeah?

388
00:18:56,340 --> 00:18:57,480
现在我来了！
So I'm here.

389
00:18:58,060 --> 00:18:59,840
怎么了？你害怕进来了？
What's the matter? Afraid to come in?

390
00:19:00,140 --> 00:19:01,920
是你害怕出来！
You're afraid to come out. Woos.

391
00:19:07,100 --> 00:19:08,340
爸爸说得真对！
Dad was right.

392
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:13,060
好，你这个小…你长高了。
Alright you little....you grew.

393
00:19:13,760 --> 00:19:14,660
你没有。
You didn't.

394
00:19:15,140 --> 00:19:16,560
我想是我的车了。
I think that's my bus.

395
00:19:17,710 --> 00:19:23,020
看吧BEN，路易这小子害怕你了。
Wow Ben. He was actually afraid of you.

396
00:19:23,020 --> 00:19:25,920
说得对，马克，每个人都害怕别人，
Yeah well Mark. Everybody's a little bit frightened.

397
00:19:26,640 --> 00:19:28,060
就看你有没有勇气。
Even big guys like me.

398
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:31,100
我不想伤任何人的心，
Now I don't want to break Elaine's heart.

399
00:19:31,100 --> 00:19:32,640
And I sure don't want to upset the blonde.

400
00:19:33,300 --> 00:19:36,400
所以我就应该定一个比较婉转的办法把其中一个姑娘打发走。
So uh,it's out of my hands and the next girl who walks round the corner,

401
00:19:37,670 --> 00:19:40,920
波拿，波拿。
is history. Ah Boner,boner..

402
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:41,980
我知道你有麻烦。
I know. Get lost.

403
00:19:42,900 --> 00:19:47,070
Mike你怎么了？
Mike. What happened?

404
00:19:47,070 --> 00:19:50,580
体操场，下蹲时扭伤了。
Ah,gym class. I misfired on a power squat.

405
00:19:50,580 --> 00:19:51,990
是吗？
No!

406
00:19:51,990 --> 00:19:55,460
对，今晚我得让医生看看。
Yeah! Look,I have to see a doctor,tonight.

407
00:19:55,460 --> 00:19:56,620
你不能去跳舞了？
So the dance is out?

408
00:19:57,620 --> 00:19:58,660
是的。我非常抱歉。
Yeah,I am really sorry Elaine,

409
00:19:58,660 --> 00:20:00,700
但我身体一好一定陪你去玩。
but I promise we will go out just as soon as I'm home.

410
00:20:02,300 --> 00:20:03,380
我希望你能谅解。
I hope you understand?

411
00:20:04,100 --> 00:20:06,640
我能谅解。我能帮你什么忙吗？
Of Course I do. Is there anything I can do to help?

412
00:20:07,750 --> 00:20:10,970
不，不必了，还是让我自己走好了。
No,I'd rather you not see me like this,ok.

413
00:20:10,970 --> 00:20:11,780
好吧，你当心点。
Ok,take care!

414
00:20:11,780 --> 00:20:13,600
知道了，再见。
You too. Bye bye.

415
00:20:14,140 --> 00:20:19,470
Hi.

416
00:20:19,470 --> 00:20:19,570
HI，

417
00:20:19,570 --> 00:20:20,270
是你？！
You!

418
00:20:20,270 --> 00:20:21,710
是我。
Me.

419
00:20:24,160 --> 00:20:28,200
听着，我非常荣幸，今晚咱们是第一次约会，
Look,I'm a class dude,and I don't want to meet my date at the dance,

420
00:20:28,280 --> 00:20:29,680
我开车来接你怎么样？
so what do you say I pick you up?

421
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:32,180
约会？我们的约会？
Date? We don't have a date.

422
00:20:32,840 --> 00:20:34,420
你答应去跳舞的。
Yes we do,for the dance tonight.

423
00:20:34,880 --> 00:20:36,820
不，我是说舞会上见。
No,I just said I'd see you there.

424
00:20:37,660 --> 00:20:39,240
噢，等一下。
Ah wait a minute.

425
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:41,420
我明白了，你有比我强的人就把我扔了！啊！
I get it! You've found someone you like better and you're dumping me.

426
00:20:42,420 --> 00:20:45,540
不，我绝不会干那种卑鄙的事，你呢？
Oh no! I could never do something like that. Could you?

427
00:20:46,690 --> 00:20:50,540
不不不，这个问题咱们还是别说了。
Ah,don't you change the subject here.

428
00:20:50,540 --> 00:20:51,720
Mike，你完全误解了。
Mike,you misunderstood.

429
00:20:52,040 --> 00:20:55,160
我没有误解。你知道我为你做了多大的牺牲。
Misunderstood! Are you...do you have any idea what I gave up for you?

430
00:20:55,240 --> 00:20:56,740
我并没有要求你这样去做呀。
I didn't ask you to give anything up.

431
00:20:56,740 --> 00:21:00,040
老实说吧，我回绝了一个姑娘，是为了和你去跳舞。
I'll tell you what,I gave up Elaine Dooley,for a date with you.

432
00:21:05,180 --> 00:21:08,880
Mike！我不和你约会，是因为我并不信任你。
Mike. I couldn't date you. I don't even trust you.

433
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:13,300
你在说不信任我之前最好先了解我。
Look! Before you mistrust me,I suggest you get to know me.

434
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:16,520
我很了解你，Mike。
I do know you Mike.

435
00:21:16,660 --> 00:21:17,400
怎么可能？
From where?

436
00:21:17,600 --> 00:21:19,500
记得去年的野餐会吗？
Do you remember the class picnic last year?

437
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:22,100
不不不，你没参加我当然不记得。
No,no. You weren't there. I would have remembered you.

438
00:21:22,300 --> 00:21:23,500
我来提示一下，
I can prove I was there.

439
00:21:23,820 --> 00:21:27,000
你模仿贝琪拔牙的腔调，弄得哄堂大笑还记得吗？
You did that really funny impression of buck tooth Becky Swarking. Remember?

440
00:21:29,920 --> 00:21:31,220
请把玉米递给我。
Pass the corn please.

441
00:21:32,140 --> 00:21:32,880
哈哈，挺滑稽的！
Very funny!

442
00:21:35,100 --> 00:21:40,560
……贝琪？！过了一个暑假你完全变了！
Becky? Boy you have had quite a summer.

443
00:21:41,380 --> 00:21:43,600
今天该你出洋相了！
And you have had quite a fall.

444
00:21:50,180 --> 00:21:51,360
HI，亲爱的。
Hi guys.

445
00:21:52,550 --> 00:21:53,150
Hi.

446
00:21:53,150 --> 00:21:53,250
HI。

447
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:55,780
我说JASON，今天你感到寂寞吗？
So Jason,were you lonely today?

448
00:22:00,900 --> 00:22:03,300
HI，BEN，今天开学第一天学到点什么？
And Ben. What did you learn your first day back?

449
00:22:03,300 --> 00:22:06,400
我学到了进犹太学校也不解决问题。
I learned that Hebrew school is not the answer.

450
00:22:08,140 --> 00:22:09,280
一会儿跟你解释。
I'll explain later.

451
00:22:14,560 --> 00:22:17,320
我说Carol，你今天一切都很顺利吗？
So Carol. Was today everything you hoped it would be?

452
00:22:17,780 --> 00:22:20,600
开关有点不太妙可后来就很顺利。
Well it started out a little shaky,but it ended up ok.

453
00:22:21,740 --> 00:22:21,980
好，很好。
Good.

454
00:22:21,980 --> 00:22:23,540
甚至有人约我去跳舞。
I even have a date for the dance.

455
00:22:24,830 --> 00:22:25,100
好极了。
Great!

456
00:22:25,100 --> 00:22:28,880
最棒的是，我甚至可以不上场。
And the best part is,I don't even have to go.

457
00:22:36,040 --> 00:22:37,840
你回来晚了，去哪了？
Mike,you're late. Where have you been?

458
00:22:38,830 --> 00:22:40,200
妈妈，我有个新的认识，
Mum. I have been doing some thinking.

459
00:22:40,200 --> 00:22:42,460
女孩子们往往会变得认不出来。
Girls have feelings just like regular people.

460
00:22:43,500 --> 00:22:45,040
Uh hu.

461
00:22:45,040 --> 00:22:47,120
妈妈你知道吗？我今天学到的，
You know mum,I think I have learned more today than

462
00:22:47,120 --> 00:22:49,200
比在学校学那么多年都多。
I have in my entire educational career.

463
00:22:49,660 --> 00:22:52,600
真是好极了。Mike。遇上好老师了。
Well that's great Mike. So do you have good teachers?

464
00:22:53,780 --> 00:22:58,660
也许学校还没有这么好的老师。
Ah,maybe. I'll find out tomorrow when I go to class.

465
00:22:58,660 --> 00:23:02,280
Jason!

466
00:23:02,280 --> 00:23:02,340
JASON。

467
00:23:02,340 --> 00:23:06,310
Mike，已经九点了，你可以了吗？
Mike. Seven o'clock comes early. Let's go pal.

468
00:23:06,310 --> 00:23:08,300
可以了。
Alright.

469
00:23:09,580 --> 00:23:11,240
Carol，明天还要上课呢。
Carol honey. School in the morning.

470
00:23:11,820 --> 00:23:13,290
对。
Alright!

471
00:23:13,290 --> 00:23:16,920
BEN，你得准备睡觉，马上就要关灯了。
Ben. Your long over due lights out now!

472
00:23:16,920 --> 00:23:19,000
别关灯，我怕黑。
No way! I'm afraid of the dark.

473
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:24,520
你知道，说起来真好笑，我在你这么大的时候，也怕黑暗。……BEN？
You know Ben. This is interesting. When I was your age,I too was...Ben.

474
00:23:25,300 --> 00:23:27,560
别说了爸爸，我爱黑暗！
Forget it dad. I love the dark.
